<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Reporte Forense - Sesión {{sessionId}}</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
      font-size: 10pt;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .header h1 {
      font-size: 24pt;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .header p {
      font-size: 11pt;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .qr-code {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #f8f9fa;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .qr-code img {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border: 3px solid #667eea;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .section {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 14pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #667eea;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #667eea;
    }

    .metadata-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .metadata-item {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
    }

    .metadata-label {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #667eea;
      font-size: 9pt;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .metadata-value {
      font-size: 10pt;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 15px;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }

    thead {
      background: #667eea;
      color: white;
    }

    th {
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 9pt;
    }

    td {
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    }

    tbody tr:nth-child(even) {
      background: #f8f9fa;
    }

    tbody tr:hover {
      background: #e8f0fe;
    }

    .event-type {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 8pt;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .event-type-session { background: #e3f2fd; color: #1976d2; }
    .event-type-location { background: #e8f5e9; color: #388e3c; }
    .event-type-forensic { background: #fff3e0; color: #f57c00; }
    .event-type-critical { background: #ffebee; color: #c62828; }

    .iso-compliance {
      background: #e8f5e9;
      border: 2px solid #4caf50;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    .iso-compliance h3 {
      color: #2e7d32;
      font-size: 12pt;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .iso-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .iso-item {
      padding: 10px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .chain-of-custody {
      background: #fff3e0;
      border: 2px solid #ff9800;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }

    .chain-of-custody h3 {
      color: #e65100;
      font-size: 12pt;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hash-value {
      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      background: white;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      word-break: break-all;
      font-size: 8pt;
      color: #d84315;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: #666;
    }

    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }

    .no-data {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #999;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    @media print {
      .section {
        page-break-inside: avoid;
      }
      .header {
        page-break-after: avoid;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <h1>🔐 Reporte Forense de Sesión</h1>
    <p>Kids4Safe v1.0.0-staging - Forensic Session Tracking Platform</p>
    <p>Documento admisible como evidencia legal (ISO 19115 compliant)</p>
  </div>

  <!-- QR CODE -->
  <div class="qr-code">
    <img src="{{qrCodeDataUrl}}" alt="QR Code {{qrId}}" />
    <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #667eea;">QR ID: {{qrId}}</p>
  </div>

  <!-- METADATA SESSION -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">📋 Metadatos de Sesión</h2>
    <div class="metadata-grid">
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Session ID</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{sessionId}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Estado</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{status}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Inicio</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{startTime}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Fin</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{endTime}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Duración</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{duration}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">User Agent</div>
        <div class="metadata-value" style="font-size: 8pt;">{{deviceInfo.userAgent}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Plataforma</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{deviceInfo.platform}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="metadata-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Resolución Pantalla</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{deviceInfo.screenResolution}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- FORENSIC TIMELINE -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">⏱️ Forensic Timeline ({{forensicEvents.length}} eventos)</h2>
    {{#if forensicEvents.length}}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Timestamp (UTC)</th>
          <th>Evento</th>
          <th>Detalles</th>
          <th>Hash SHA-256</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each forensicEvents}}
        <tr>
          <td style="white-space: nowrap;">{{this.timestamp}}</td>
          <td>
            <span class="event-type event-type-{{#if (contains this.eventType 'SESSION')}}session{{else if (contains this.eventType 'LOCATION')}}location{{else if (contains this.eventType 'TAB')}}forensic{{else}}critical{{/if}}">
              {{this.eventType}}
            </span>
          </td>
          <td style="font-size: 8pt; max-width: 200px; word-break: break-word;">{{this.details}}</td>
          <td style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 7pt; word-break: break-all;">{{this.hash}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{else}}
    <div class="no-data">No hay eventos forenses registrados</div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <!-- GPS ROUTE -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">📍 Ruta GPS ({{locations.length}} puntos)</h2>
    {{#if locations.length}}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Timestamp (UTC)</th>
          <th>Latitud</th>
          <th>Longitud</th>
          <th>Precisión</th>
          <th>Fuente</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each locations}}
        <tr>
          <td style="white-space: nowrap;">{{this.timestamp}}</td>
          <td>{{this.latitude}}</td>
          <td>{{this.longitude}}</td>
          <td>{{this.accuracy}}</td>
          <td>{{this.source}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{else}}
    <div class="no-data">No hay datos de geolocalización</div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <!-- SCREENSHOTS -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">📸 Screenshots ({{screenshots.length}} capturas)</h2>
    {{#if screenshots.length}}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Timestamp (UTC)</th>
          <th>URL de evidencia</th>
          <th>Tamaño</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each screenshots}}
        <tr>
          <td style="white-space: nowrap;">{{this.timestamp}}</td>
          <td style="font-size: 7pt; word-break: break-all;">{{this.url}}</td>
          <td>{{this.size}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{else}}
    <div class="no-data">No hay screenshots capturadas</div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <!-- RECORDINGS -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">🎥 Grabaciones ({{recordings.length}} videos)</h2>
    {{#if recordings.length}}
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Timestamp (UTC)</th>
          <th>URL de evidencia</th>
          <th>Duración</th>
          <th>Tamaño</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {{#each recordings}}
        <tr>
          <td style="white-space: nowrap;">{{this.timestamp}}</td>
          <td style="font-size: 7pt; word-break: break-all;">{{this.url}}</td>
          <td>{{this.duration}}</td>
          <td>{{this.size}}</td>
        </tr>
        {{/each}}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {{else}}
    <div class="no-data">No hay grabaciones de video</div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <!-- ISO 19115 COMPLIANCE -->
  <div class="iso-compliance">
    <h3>🌍 ISO 19115 - Metadata Geográfico Internacional</h3>
    <div class="iso-grid">
      <div class="iso-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Sistema de Coordenadas</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{iso19115.coordinateSystem}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="iso-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Precisión</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{iso19115.accuracy}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="iso-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Linaje (Lineage)</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{iso19115.lineage}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="iso-item">
        <div class="metadata-label">Fecha Generación</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{iso19115.dateGenerated}}</div>
      </div>
      <div class="iso-item" style="grid-column: span 2;">
        <div class="metadata-label">Extensión Espacial</div>
        <div class="metadata-value">{{iso19115.spatialExtent}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 9pt; color: #2e7d32;">
      ✅ Este documento cumple con el estándar internacional ISO 19115:2014 para metadata geográfico y es admisible como evidencia legal en tribunales.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- CHAIN OF CUSTODY -->
  <div class="chain-of-custody">
    <h3>🔒 Chain of Custody (Cadena de Custodia)</h3>
    <div class="metadata-item" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
      <div class="metadata-label">Algoritmo</div>
      <div class="metadata-value">{{chainOfCustody.algorithm}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metadata-item" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
      <div class="metadata-label">Hash de Sesión (SHA-256)</div>
      <div class="hash-value">{{chainOfCustody.sessionHash}}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="metadata-item">
      <div class="metadata-label">Timestamp Verificación</div>
      <div class="metadata-value">{{chainOfCustody.timestamp}}</div>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 9pt; color: #e65100;">
      ⚠️ Cualquier modificación posterior a los datos de esta sesión resultará en un hash SHA-256 diferente, invalidando la cadena de custodia. Este hash garantiza la integridad de la evidencia.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <div class="footer">
    <p><strong>Kids4Safe {{version}}</strong> - Forensic Session Tracking Platform</p>
    <p>Reporte generado: {{generatedAt}}</p>
    <p>Este documento es confidencial y está protegido por GDPR/LOPD. TTL: 90 días desde fin de sesión.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 8pt; color: #999;">
      © 2026 Kids4Safe. Todos los derechos reservados. ISO 19115 compliant.
    </p>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
